2
00:07:26,399 --> 00:07:32,399
Clean is a crime, action, drama film directed by Paul Solet.

3
00:11:09,599 --> 00:11:15,599
Tormented by a past life, garbage man Clean attempts a life of quiet redemption.

4
00:14:52,799 --> 00:14:58,799
But when his good intentions mark him a target of a local crime boss,
Clean is forced to reconcile with the violence of his past.

5
00:18:36,000 --> 00:18:42,000
Clean, played by Adrien Brody.

6
00:22:19,199 --> 00:22:25,199
Michael, played by Glenn Fleshler.

7
