11
00:40:55,199 --> 00:41:01,199
Clean is an Australian 2022 documentary film about the life of Sandra Pankhurst, a transgender
woman who became best known for her work as a crime scene and trauma cleaner.

12
00:44:38,399 --> 00:44:44,399
The film centres on Pankhurst's journey from a difficult upbringing—which included adoption and an
eventual teenage eviction—to her marriage and experiences with gender identity.

13
00:48:21,599 --> 00:48:27,599
The film follows Pankhurst's early struggles with the eventual establishment of Specialist Trauma Cleaning Services, which has a
team of cleaners who clean crime scenes, places where people have committed suicide, and incidents of hoarding.

14
00:52:04,799 --> 00:52:10,799
Pankhurst attends and leads jobs with her team while sharing her experiences and
challenges of the industry as well as showcasing the nature of her profession.

15
00:55:48,000 --> 00:55:54,000
As the film progresses, Pankhurst's health declines, possibly
due to extended exposure to cleaning substances.

16
00:59:31,199 --> 00:59:37,199
Nevertheless, she continues with her work and actively
participates in public speaking engagements.

17
01:03:14,399 --> 01:03:20,399
The cast includes Pankhurst, who plays herself, and her employees.

18
01:06:57,599 --> 01:07:03,599
The film was produced by David Elliot-Jones and Charlotte Wheaton of Walking Fish Productions and directed
by Lachlan Mcleod who had been inspired by Pankhurst's story after seeing her on television.

19
01:10:40,800 --> 01:10:46,800
Clean was released in 2022.

20
01:14:24,000 --> 01:14:30,000
The film was screened at the Melbourne International Film
Festival and the Edinburgh International Film Festival.

21
01:18:07,199 --> 01:18:13,199
It was nominated for two awards at the Australian Academy of
Cinema and Television Arts Awards in 2022.

22
01:21:50,399 --> 01:21:56,399
Audiences and critics received Clean well.

23
01:25:33,599 --> 01:25:39,599
The film explores themes of new york city,
garbageman , gangster, drug use, revenge.

24
01:29:16,799 --> 01:29:22,799
The tone is emotional.
